flowchart LR
 A[Approved job plan and roster] --> B[Collect activity, CST, recall and fatigue data]
 B --> C[Compare delivered and planned activity]
 C --> D{Material variation or review due?}
 D -- No --> E[Record assurance and continue monitoring]
 E --> B
 D -- Yes --> F[Consult officer and assess service impact]
 F --> G[Adjust hours, scope, resources or service model]
 G --> H[Validate agreement, industrial compliance and approval]
 H --> A
